a&_nc_ohc=rvUAwUEO3A8Q7kNvwFxn60X&_nc_oc=Adpi5ZuVWeSGik0y-3XX4e2gmky2obeP6mOYz0xzGtuSK000XkHvunIkkFLGYXigL2c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLiSkk3O1c_RpihjgwJm23NAOTHwc_U1hS6DORjBPcQfA&oe=6AA170C6"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_007_0003.png", "id": "845763184505694", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_845763187839027_468447991220621964_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vi6_tJVql4AQ7kNvwG2ie4T&_nc_oc=AdoBl6twg8n5iZO2v53leonq-v716qLi4q-7ejhOqZOzecfHsSS_qDw5ly0Ksg5VKrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJK7Asf_NPKU8l5T0LvgbFoCOjCK_zLK4XyOnbUIHsgcA&oe=6AA15E2C"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_003_0002.png", "id": "1836602476962685", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_1836602480296018_8280261062432359374_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TJrplumyadoQ7kNvwE8GSvE&_nc_oc=AdpK2GY8jgLvE1E2pN-flYeDDuUM4dh5P0yMH0wWkdGQSRkKKNGkiD_7y_Zcv9Fr61Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL5unh8fgtZ5h_Fo_xuQIYMjr7lRL-5zXSB9Dkgb_lFJQ&oe=6AA15B03"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_004_0000.png", "id": "1138993271704566", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1138993275037899_3311993198849045458_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xz8lHlrh8GAQ7kNvwEUNxce&_nc_oc=Adpj7zGvhVLAqHYxD0y1lWmWIXHy37t1_jlfEasXDEkn3DYLLZlCQXkK8hYvL423EgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLpgNkLrSKTJqKVrZvUGaOScjpvoXkeShA7-nEIyR7v4Q&oe=6AA15E13"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_006_0001.png", "id": "847449181015275", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_847449184348608_15613528115627936_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mnspihM189UQ7kNvwEUwq0L&_nc_oc=AdpESP3ws1WhITINb_RYkAC1eY_zaCnTnumrw25zPf-aY1_dTiXXRar6VW2ar0gqqwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIJadUt1n_28JLk_mt0hvjfxZT0JYd7eJ7fOAH52vA8xw&oe=6AA15781"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zibby", "keywords": ["social", "casual", "free", "gorilla", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Zibby!\n\nZibby is not just game. Zibby is lifestyle. Enter the world, be the Zibby.\n\n# Bonk & Snack\nSee that Spitflower? It has gems inside. BONK the Spitflower. Gem falls out? Don't put in pocket. EAT IT. Crunchy victory.\n\n{847821848000023}\n\n# Shop Like a Boss\nWhy look boring? Go to store. We have everything! Buy funny hat. Buy cool gadget. Buy shiny things. Look fresh, impress friends. Spend your hard-earned cash here.\n\n{1280599737210708}\n\n# Dig Deep, Eat Dark\nGrab pickaxe. Find rock. Smash rock! Oh look, coal pieces! Are you hungry? Yes. Eat the coal. Mining is tasty work.\n\n{2308405566240054}\n\n# Zoom and Boing\nWalking is for slow people. Use Jumppad: BOING! Fly high. Use Zipline: WHOOSH! Go fast. Explore the world like a pro. Never touch ground again.\n\n{722552094239314}\n\n# The Circle of Life\nSimple life. Good life. Walk -> Grab -> Bonk Mob -> EAT. Mine Rock -> Get Coal -> EAT. -> Sell loot -> Get rich -> Repeat. This is the Zibby way.\n\n{3001593293368798}\n\n**Rise through the skies. Serve the kingdom. Become Zibby.**\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Explore floating island biomes as Zibby, servant of the kingdom. Team up with friends to hunt monsters, mine rare resources, and uncover secrets across a vast sky-realm. Collect valuable drops, sell them in the castle safe zone, and upgrade your gear. New islands, enemies, and tools arrive with every update\u2014your adventure never stops!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminagames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Limina Games", "support_website_url": "https://liminagames.com/discord", "website_url": "https://liminagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST"